<title>USA: River Grove, Ill., won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>River Grove, Ill., won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $1.485 million of River Grove, Ill., installment contract refunding certificates, series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.89 percent.</p>
</text>
